          "ambiguityReviewed": true,
          "unresolvedIdentity": true,
          "reason": "王叔仁 is the courtesy name of Wang Yun (s0230 王蘊，字叔仁), who asked to be sent out to a command. The local record's personal-name claim \"Wang Shu\" (c0047) and the s0021 English \"Wang Shu\" are wrong: Wang Shu (述) is a different man (s0223). Held until the name is corrected; the referent itself is attested.",
